%% Measurement of a property: A measurement (assay) of a property of a sample, with a result that has a value and a unit, done according to a written method.

    Measurement["<b>Measurement</b><br>OBI_0000070 assay"]:::local
    Sample["<b>Sample</b><br>PMD_0000000 material"]:::local
    Property["<b>Property</b><br>BFO_0000019 quality"]:::local
    Result["<b>Result</b><br>IAO_0000109 measurement datum"]:::local
    Value["<b>Value</b><br>OBI_0001931 scalar value specification<br><br>numeric value, unit"]:::local
    Plan["<b>Plan</b><br>OBI_0000260 plan"]:::local
    Method["<b>Method or standard</b><br>IAO_0000033 directive information entity"]:::local

    Measurement -. "has specified input<br>OBI_0000293" .-> Sample
    Measurement -. "has specified output<br>OBI_0000299" .-> Result
    Measurement -. "assay measures characteristic<br>RO_0009006" .-> Property
    Sample -. "has characteristic<br>RO_0000053" .-> Property
    Result -. "has value specification<br>OBI_0001938" .-> Value
    Value -. "specifies value of<br>OBI_0001927" .-> Property
    Result -. "is quality measurement of<br>IAO_0000221" .-> Property
    Result -. "is about<br>IAO_0000136" .-> Sample
    Measurement -. "realizes<br>BFO_0000055" .-> Plan
    Plan -. "concretizes<br>RO_0000059" .-> Method

    classDef local fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f172a

